ok - --absorb acknowledges an all-routine wake, persistent open decisions included
ok - --absorb retires routine rows of an actionable wake and leaves the rest to the printed acknowledgement
ok - --absorb keeps every wake that needs firstmate and validates its arguments
ok - closed all-routine output remains pending until replayed without absorbing
ok - an interrupted --absorb handoff keeps its output, and the retry replays it instead of absorbing
